DESCRIPTION:Originally hailing from San Francisco\, Caitlin Peluffo is a Ne
 w York based stand-up comedian. She was in the final 4 for Kevin Hart’s F
 unny AF on Netflix\, gaining over 100k new fans across the country and a fe
 aturing spot on Nikki Glaser’s next tour. This lovable loose cannon made 
 her network television debut on  The Late Show with Stephen Colbert \, was
  featured on the  Late Late Show with James Corden \, and appeared on the
   Tonight Show starring Jimmy Fallon  where she received a standing ovati
 on. She has been seen on  CBS’s After Midnight \,  Comedy Central’s 
 ‘Featuring’  series\, and was a Just for Laughs New Face in Montreal. 
 She regularly opens for Matteo Lane and Fortune Feimster and has mastered t
 he NYC comedy scene performing at the world-renowned Comedy Cellar\, New Yo
 rk Comedy Club\, and Gotham Comedy Club\, among others.\nMore info: https:/
